  {
    "location": "html-block:6",
    "text": "Manufacturing for BUS1000/2000 has been discontinued. As an alternative,please see MIB, B30, B90, or B95Plus.",
    "heading": "BUS1000/2000 Bus Bar Protection - Legacy"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:7",
    "text": "The BUS 1000/2000 is a solid state, high speed protection system for the detection of phase-to-phase and phase-to-ground faults on bus bar installations. It can be used to protect high voltage bus bar installations of any voltage.",
    "heading": "BUS1000/2000 Bus Bar Protection - Legacy"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:8",
    "text": "BUS 2000 models add to the functionality of the BUS 1000 through the metering, monitoring, event recording, waveform capture, and IRIG-B time synchronization capabilities of the DMS metering and monitoring module.",
    "heading": "BUS1000/2000 Bus Bar Protection - Legacy"
  },
